! BOSS App — v0.8.1 OSPF sidecar config, CONSUMER role (freeradius,
! genieacs-cwmp, genieacs-nbi, librenms, librenms-dispatcher).
!
! Deliberately NO `redistribute` statement of any kind — a consumer forms
! full OSPF adjacency (Hello/DBD/LSA) and LEARNS routes from the 3 node
! routers, but never announces anything of its own back into the domain.
! This is NOT FRR's `passive-interface` (that means "don't even form
! adjacency, just stub-announce the connected subnet" — the opposite of
! what we want: we need real adjacency to actually receive LSAs).
!
! __HELLO__ / __DEAD__ / __AUTH_KEY__ / __ROUTER_ID__ are substituted by
! entrypoint.sh at container start (per-deployment values, not baked into
! the image).
hostname frr-consumer
log stdout
!
router ospf
 ospf router-id __ROUTER_ID__
 network 172.28.0.0/24 area 0.0.0.0
!
interface eth0
 ip ospf hello-interval __HELLO__
 ip ospf dead-interval __DEAD__
 ip ospf authentication message-digest
 ip ospf message-digest-key 1 md5 __AUTH_KEY__
 ip ospf network broadcast
!
line vty
!
